        <mxCell id="X_Bc3YQo2dtKVS5Ca0FN-54" value="Project description:&lt;div&gt;- A collection of tools for personal use, which includes Project Manger, Tool register, Task Planner.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Compoennets:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- DataMgr - component used by all other component that provides uniform access to data for all other components.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Provides paths for each components data folders&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Allows to edit and change data folder for each component separatly or for all at the same time&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- allows to migrate data from one folder to other.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- (future?) implemetns online syncronization and data management for cloud service&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- ToolRegister - more of a tag collection to help mentally track all tool&amp;nbsp; and programs on my machine&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- manage and track all tool on my machine&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- hold some tool specific templates and scripts for inclusion and creation of projects&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- ProjectMgr - manages all personal projects on and outside this machine.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- manage and track projects&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- create project templates&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- build project configuration and add specific tools&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- TaskPlanner - simple todo list and more organizational features to track progress, and manage events and plans.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Todo lists&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Event planning&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- TimeTable planning&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- MainGoal and paths planning&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=light-dark(#7db0ff, #ededed);align=left;fillColor=default;html=1;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;perimeterSpacing=0;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="480" width="770" height="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
